Cell["\<\
A common use case, known from the SM, is to have massless chiral fermions. In \
that case, one can also invoke the mass option to obtain\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1320755931,ExpressionUUID->"6601ef44-d626-4885-bd3b-63ad837a4f21"],

